# asdf toolchain for emisar — `asdf install` from the repo root provisions the dev
# environment for every toolchain, and this file is the single source of truth
# for the Erlang + Elixir pins: the combined CI workflow reads it via setup-beam (version-file
# + version-type: strict), and the tooling gate fails when portal/Dockerfile's
# digest-pinned builder defaults drift from it — so CI and the release image
# always match dev. golang: go.work + every go.mod and local development share the
# current security patch because CI and release builds use go-version-file.
# Go has no asdf plugin by default — run `asdf plugin add golang` once, then install.
erlang 29.0.6
elixir 1.20.4-otp-29
golang 1.27.1
# infra/ — Google Cloud DNS in Terraform; run `asdf plugin add terraform` once.
terraform 1.16.2
# infra/ — the canonical gate and CI use this same linter release.
tflint 0.64.0
